        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    total_billed_amount = 10000\n    deductible = 1200\n    coinsurance_rate = 0.20\n    out_of_pocket_max = 3000\n    \n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    remaining_cost = max(total_billed_amount - deductible, 0)\n    coinsurance_cost = remaining_cost * coinsurance_rate\n    total_out_of_pocket = min(\n        deductible + coinsurance_cost,\n        out_of_pocket_max\n    )\n    \n    # return answer\n    return round(total_out_of_pocket)\n```",
